{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mineshaft_t1","model_identifier":"mineshaft_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mineshaft_t1\n\nMineshaft tier 1: a timber head-frame over a square shaft with a hand winch, rope and bucket.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -44..44, y 0..56, z -20..18 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 20, construction_0 8, construction_33 17, construction_66 24, ruined 5 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- head-frame: 32 x 60 x 32 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `mineshaft_t1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `mineshaft_t1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_mineshaft_t1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `winch` turns, `bucket` rises and falls. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -24)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-34, 0, -28)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"collar","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.0,0.0,-18.0],"to":[18.0,4.0,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[50.0,96.0,86.0,100.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50.0,96.0,86.0,100.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[50.0,96.0,86.0,100.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[50.0,96.0,86.0,100.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[21.0,0.0,57.0,36.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[21.0,0.0,57.0,36.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f548f98d-2323-585d-b18d-3eb37a67313a"},{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14.0,0.0,-14.0],"to":[14.0,4.2,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22.0,96.8,50.0,101.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[22.0,96.8,50.0,101.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[22.0,96.8,50.0,101.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[22.0,96.8,50.0,101.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[57.0,0.0,85.0,28.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[57.0,0.0,85.0,28.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e61fe59d-9e0f-55de-a912-e98cbd1e8c83"},{"name":"hf_leg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.0,4.0,-16.0],"to":[-12.0,56.0,-12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,52.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,52.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,52.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,52.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[96.0,102.0,100.0,106.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[96.0,102.0,100.0,106.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"08311a90-1e27-56cb-9def-4b480b0fd6c9"},{"name":"hf_leg1","box_uv":false,"res